WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
[Soft ambient music]
The Last Light. A small story from a very large universe.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Even in the deepest dark, something is becoming.

00:13.400 --> 00:18.000
An ending can travel a long way before it becomes a beginning.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
Somewhere, a first sunrise. And a story still unwritten.
